 mean I have alex guarnaschelli's phone  number on like if i have a problem with  a recipe i can text her I also think  that our judges are super knowledgeable  very entertaining funny we've had a  little bit of foment in our judges ranks  and our most recent acquisition Martha  Stewart I think is a very very exciting  one I've been a fan of hers for 25 years  and now I get to work with her it's  amazing well I'm super grateful super  proud I love our team it's a well-oiled  machine of really great people and  letting almost entirely by women which i  think is exciting in television and  we're we're happy to keep making them as  long as you want to watch them
 

